  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-chatbi",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin for **ChatBI-style tooling**: database connections, MCP/API/SQL tool registry, and agent tools — **fully self-contained**, no external ChatBI Java backend required.\n\nNot affiliated with DeepSeek."
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "All data lives in a local JSON store on the Host:\n\n```\n$DSH_HOME/chatbi/store.json\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "| Area                 | Storage     | Execution                                                                   |\n| -------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Database connections | local store | **SQLite** via Node built-in `node:sqlite`; other types stored for metadata |\n| MCP servers & tools  | local store | HTTP POST to configured server `baseUrl`                                    |\n| SQL tools            | local store | Template → `chatbi_sql_execute`                                             |\n| API tools            | local store | HTTP fetch to configured `baseUrl` + path                                   |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "Settings UI layout follows chatbi-ui tab patterns, built with **Tailwind CSS v4**.\nCompiled utilities are embedded into `lib/client.js` and injected at runtime\n(DSH ModuleLoader does not load sidecar `.css` files)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./\n```\n\nNode ≥22."
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings",
      "text": "**Settings → ChatBI**:\n\n- Optional **data directory** override (default `$DSH_HOME/chatbi`)\n- Tabs: 概览 / 数据库 / MCP 工具 / API 工具 / SQL 工具"
    },
    {
      "section": "Agent tools",
      "text": "| Tool                 | Purpose                    |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `chatbi_status`      | Local store summary        |\n| `chatbi_sql_execute` | Run SQL (sqlite supported) |\n| `chatbi_mcp_call`    | Invoke registered MCP tool |\n| `chatbi_api_call`    | Invoke registered API tool |\n| `chatbi_list_*`      | List MCP / SQL / API tools |\n\nSkill `dsh-chatbi` documents the workflow."
    },
    {
      "section": "Verify",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm install --legacy-peer-deps\nnpm test\nnpm run build\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limitations",
      "text": "- MySQL/PostgreSQL: connections are stored locally; live SQL needs drivers not bundled (use sqlite or MCP/API tools).\n- MCP invoke assumes an HTTP endpoint on the configured server (generic JSON body).\n- Seed MCP/SQL/API tools by editing `store.json` or extend the UI later."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT — see [LICENSE](LICENSE)."
    }
  ],
